  "auditFindings": {
    "homelessConcepts": [
      "Logging facade: none. Sinks are scattered: AppCommandState::log (command line), SaveTrace (Core), UpdateService LogSilently (Network), StartupFailure startup-failure.log (Windows), and Qt qWarning/qDebug calls in src/qt. The final map must decide whether Core owns one facade or only the file sink.",
      "Settings store: AppCommandState holds nearly all settings in one god struct. There is no Settings system. Core owns the value vocabulary; the holder and its consumers belong to the final map.",
      "Duration and ETA text: FormatEtaRemaining is pure formatting used only by a progress UI. Core or UI?",
      "Lat/long DMS label: FormatLatLongLabel and CadCommands_Geo FormatDms. Geo or Core formatting?",
      "Plot-scale labels: PlotScaleChoicesFor and PlotScaleLabel (util/PlotScales.hpp) are Document or Plot, not Core.",
      "Slope text: FormatSlope (CadCommands.cpp) is grading/Terrain.",
      "Station text: FormatStation (Alignment) belongs to Alignment, not Core."
    ],
    "couplings": [
      "Foot/meter conversion constants are duplicated in several systems: geo/DrawingConversion.cpp, io/LandXmlIo.cpp, pdf/PdfMeasure.cpp, traverse/JobXmlImport.cpp, traverse/TraverseCalc.cpp, traverse/TraverseLeastSquares.cpp (kMetersToFeet), traverse/StarNetImport.cpp. Core units should own them.",
      "34 local trim/lower/upper/StartsWith helpers are defined outside src/core (for example io/DxfIo.cpp Trim, io/WikiHelp.cpp ToLowerAscii, traverse/StarNetImport.cpp TrimCopy, ui/CommandBar.hpp TrimAscii). StringUtil exists but only 9 files include it.",
      "CadFormatBearingCwNorthDegMinSec and CadFormatAngleDegMinSecFromRad in CadCommands.cpp duplicate Core FormatBearing and FormatSweptAngle. Core.cpp says FormatBearing reproduces the first.",
      "AppCommandState stores angle display as raw ints (angleDisplayType). CadAngleDisplaySettings (Commands) converts them to the typed Core AngleDisplaySettings on every call.",
      "DrawingSettings (Document, per-drawing) embeds the AngularUnits and FootDefinition enums that Core units should own.",
      "io/UserPrefs.cpp reads and writes AppCommandState settings fields directly, so the IO system depends on Commands state.",
      "SaveTrace (Core) calls Win32 GetTempPathW and DeleteFileW directly. Core must not own platform APIs, so the path lookup belongs to the Windows system or should be injected.",
      "SaveTrace is called from io/DwgIo.cpp and io/LibreDwgCad.cpp. It is temporary diagnostics for issue #167 and can be deleted when that issue closes."
    ],
    "misMappedFolders": [
      "mappedFolders src/font/ -> Core is wrong. src/font holds the SHX file loader (ShxFont.*: file format, IO) and font-name classification (CadFontName.hpp: Renderer or Document). Not changed in this PR; the final-map ticket should reassign it. ADR-022 calls it a 'shared lower layer', which the final map must reconcile."
    ],
    "namespaceGaps": [
